-- index moved ahead of the banner foreign key that needs it, and the
-- functions and triggers at the end (immutable columns and a strictly
-- increasing version on rooms, the Top Friends size trim, the deferred
-- "0 or 7 widgets" check, the Top Friends insert guard, and the removal of
-- Top Friends on unfriend and on block). Expand-only: no existing row changes.
